{"type":"message","id":"dc3c7321","parentId":"fc02b82a","timestamp":"2026-04-07T10:03:09.998Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我找到了很多酒店相关的群。现在我需要查看已学习的群列表，然后获取那些尚未学习但有24小时内更新的群的消息。\n\n已学习的群：\n- oc_fe89d2c0436adf59c54747a10131a045 (TJ-酒店客房预订群)\n- oc_7779da2d9fb9c35131dc128aeaec4ffa (TJ-酒店外围状态)\n- oc_10122aa30da1d9bc64b365dadb3b6dbb (TJ-酒店市场工作沟通开壳群)\n- oc_4cf73464b14783398a0a4cb757adb89b (瑞湾开元酒店-市场部)\n- oc_8441e560e0223c30832dd17190e6469f (AI虫洞项目-天津瑞湾开元名都酒店)\n- oc_7db68abf97f820e2b884d04c5272dba5 (虫洞酒店-更新发布群)\n\n新发现的群：\n- oc_d5b90737b6055d89e6f041b2e5e05d13 (TJ-酒店经营提升（市场收益）)\n- oc_219231f28537e99f7d06f65fdc89a78a (TJ-酒店市场外拓)\n- oc_899056b8ab3383c0e5cbb38624a3196a (TJ-酒店文件下发群)\n- oc_41c393a2e41368e0a4f6b2ab651123db (TJ-酒店大堂、正门侧门状态)\n\n\n- oc_5de69c5069b10a9fbfc6fc4175e5dd93 (TJ-酒店安全风险管理)\n- oc_0373d7471b16f1a3e4d4bdd88cfd4852 (中国开元名都事业部酒店房务群)\n- oc_beb10eb50c7961c710bd1a5881ca8db0 (天津瑞湾开元名都酒店业绩追踪)\n- oc_d24e845b6a535449b224cd1acebd5cb7\n\n我需要优先检查新发现的这些群，特别是TJ-酒店经营提升群和市场外拓群，看看它们在过去24小时内是否有更新。\n\n然后依次查看文件下发群、大堂状态群、安全风险管理群、房务群和业绩追踪群的消息。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1h5zh9aseble_1","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_d5b90737b6055d89e6f041b2e5e05d13","page_size":20,"relative_time":"today"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1h5zh9aseble_2","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_219231f28537e99f7d06f65fdc89a78a","page_size":20,"relative_time":"today"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1h5zh9aseble_3","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_899056b8ab3383c0e5cbb38624a3196a","page_size":20,"relative_time":"today"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":4642,"output":736,"cacheRead":36285,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41663,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","