{"type":"message","id":"a7f51f54","parentId":"e3aeef45","timestamp":"2026-04-07T10:03:44.587Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我找到了一个今天有更新的群：\n- \"虫洞一组总经理沟通群\" (oc_4e890ccbd87ec2216e47c009e523676d) - 今天有新消息，是关于虫洞门店周报的\n\n还有一个是\"中国开元名都事业部酒店房务群\" (oc_0373d7471b16f1a3e4d4bdd88cfd4852) - 今天有新消息\n\n让我再检查一些其他群，看看是否有更多更新的。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6ujju6zba6gw_1","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_4a9234b5a29bd6fd1dd950ff8004c87f","page_size":20,"relative_time":"today"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6ujju6zba6gw_2","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_8de0ee6c766105ebd6c47bb9c234bcf6","page_size":20,"relative_time":"today"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":1502,"output":252,"cacheRead":45245,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46999,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775556216010,"responseId":"chatcmpl-456bfc7b-7026-47fd-b65a-f704a3d51a36"}}
